WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:06,740
Come and have a drink and sit down

2
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:08,540
This wine was left for you by your father

3
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:10,430
Drinking it will make you warm

4
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:12,430
No, can't drink

5
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:13,830
I can't go back after drinking it

6
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:15,630
Karma, stop it

7
00:00:15,630 --> 00:00:17,230
Drink Why not drink

8
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:19,990
Give me a drink quickly

9
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:21,790
Mom, why are you crying?

10
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:24,040
What happened outside?

11
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:29,360
Xiaodie, your father is gone

12
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:32,160
What is that? Where are dad and grandpa?

13
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:37,360
Why are you still opening your eyes?

14
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:40,100
Where is Lao Zhou? He hasn't come back yet.

15
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,900
How can you drown in a puddle?

16
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:47,110
Diezi, dad is going out for a day

17
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:50,980
Why are you doing this?

18
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:53,180
The person who died unexpectedly will be suspended for one night.

19
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:57,180
Guan Guan will be buried early tomorrow morning

20
00:00:57,180 --> 00:00:59,380
I originally prepared this for myself

21
00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:00,980
It's all my father's fault

22
00:01:00,980 --> 00:01:03,180
Or let them find a chance

23
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:05,580
And, dad, I'm sorry for you

24
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:08,580
Why is the fire-breathing whip surrounded by a circle of black shadows?

25
00:01:08,580 --> 00:01:16,160
what on earth are they
